{{!--
  "At a glance" — the facts a visitor used to have to ask for.

  Gaynor answers the same handful of questions by contact form over and over
  (price, day, next start, venue, class size, what to bring), so they are page
  furniture now rather than FAQ answers. Two shapes, chosen by the model's
  `glance`: "course" for the six group courses, "session" for one-to-one work
  and behaviour consultations, which are priced per visit and have no dates.

  Per-page values come from the model (`ages`, `when`, `price`, `schedule`,
  `nextStart`, `startNote`, `askVetDate`); everything shared comes from
  src/config/business.js, so a changed fact reaches all nine pages at once.

  "Next course starts" degrades nextStart -> schedule -> startNote ->
  courses.cycleNote and is never blank: Platinum has no fixed date (its dates
  are agreed with the group at Gold graduation) and a blank row reads as an
  omission.

  `schedule` is computed per build by src/controllers/course.js from the
  timetable anchor in src/config/business.js, so the date is right six weeks
  from now without anyone retyping it. When it reports a `current` course the
  row says so, because a visitor reading in week one can still join at week
  two and should not be sent away to wait six weeks. A literal `nextStart`
  on a record beats it — that is the manual override for a cancelled or
  moved block, and a record carrying one is given no `schedule` at all, so
  the override holds in the browser too.

  The `<dd>` also carries the next twelve starts as data attributes, and
  src/assets/js/site.js re-picks the right one on load. The site builds on
  push, not on a schedule, so without that a page deployed in October would
  still name an October date in December. The text rendered here is the
  default that a crawler and a reader without JavaScript see, and it is left
  alone once the list runs out.

  Rendered in `main`, never inside a layout hero — the hero caption box styles
  every descendant with arbitrary-variant selectors and would repaint the links
  and text inside this card (see CLAUDE.md).
--}}
<section class="mb-8 rounded-card border border-sand-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8">
  <h2 class="mb-5 font-display text-xl text-ink-900">At a glance</h2>

  {{#if (eq model.glance "session")}}

    <dl class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">At A1K9</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">
          <span class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-700">{{config.business.sessions.atA1K9}}</span><br>
          <span class="text-ink-600">{{config.business.sessions.length}}</span>
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">At your home</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">
          <span class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-700">{{config.business.sessions.atHome}}</span><br>
          <span class="text-ink-600">{{config.business.sessions.travelNote}}</span>
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">How soon</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">{{config.business.sessions.lead}}</dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Good to know</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">{{config.business.sessions.note}}.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

  {{else}}

    <dl class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {{#if model.ages}}
      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Who it&rsquo;s for</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">{{model.ages}}</dd>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      {{#if model.price}}
      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Price</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">
          <span class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-700">{{model.price}}</span>
          {{#if model.priceNote}}<br><span class="text-ink-600">{{model.priceNote}}</span>{{/if}}
        </dd>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      {{#if model.when}}
      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">When</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">{{model.when}}</dd>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Next course starts</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0"{{#if model.schedule}} data-schedule-starts="{{join model.schedule.upcoming}}" data-schedule-time="{{model.schedule.time}}"{{/if}}>
          {{#if model.nextStart}}{{model.nextStart}}{{else}}{{#if model.schedule}}{{#if model.schedule.current}}Started {{model.schedule.current}}. You can still join on week two. The next course starts {{model.schedule.next}}.{{else}}{{model.schedule.next}}{{/if}}{{else}}{{#if model.startNote}}{{model.startNote}}{{else}}{{config.business.courses.cycleNote}}{{/if}}{{/if}}{{/if}}
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Where</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">
          {{config.business.courses.venueNote}}.
          <ul class="mt-1 mb-0 list-none space-y-0.5 pl-0 text-sm text-ink-600">
            {{#each config.business.locations}}
              <li>{{name}}, {{address.addressLocality}}</li>
            {{/each}}
          </ul>
          <a href="{{link "contact" canonical=true}}" class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 underline underline-offset-4">Maps and directions</a>
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Class size</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">
          {{config.business.courses.classSize}}.
          <span class="text-ink-600">{{config.business.courses.joinBy}}.</span>
        </dd>
      </div>

      <div>
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink-500 uppercase">Bring</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 mb-0">
          {{config.business.courses.bring}}{{#if model.askVetDate}}, and your vet card to the first class{{/if}}.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <p class="mt-6 mb-0 border-t border-sand-200 pt-4 text-sm text-ink-600">
      {{config.business.courses.eligibilityNote}}.
    </p>

  {{/if}}
</section>
